  "ruleText": "Frl 103.04 Meetings. The board shall meet monthly or at such other times as may be called for by the chairman or by vote of the board.\n\nSource. #6927, eff 1-1-99; ss by #14456, eff 1-1-26 (formerly Frl 103.05)",
